'''Olga''' (オルガ ''Oruga'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Olga
|image = E 090.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 600¢ - 2370¢
}}

==Enemy==
She has higher health and damage than [[Nono (Enemy)|Nono]], as well as more standing range. However, she has a longer attack frequency and low movement speed.

